WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.038 --> 00:00:03.538
(dance music)

00:00:04.493 --> 00:00:06.231
- Hi, my name is David Dang.

00:00:06.231 --> 00:00:08.502
I'm a hairstylist and trichologist.

00:00:08.502 --> 00:00:10.135
To have even four men,

00:00:10.135 --> 00:00:11.053
come to the shoot today.

00:00:11.053 --> 00:00:13.133
To speak about the potential of hair loss

00:00:13.133 --> 00:00:16.212
or the subject of hair loss is huge.

00:00:16.212 --> 00:00:19.189
(upbeat music)

00:00:19.189 --> 00:00:22.292
So, why do you think
that you have hair loss?

00:00:22.292 --> 00:00:23.615
- My dad is bald.

00:00:23.615 --> 00:00:27.365
my brother's hairline
is worse than LeBron's.

00:00:28.609 --> 00:00:30.093
I think I'm next.

00:00:30.093 --> 00:00:32.535
- Prior to this, I had a topknot

00:00:32.535 --> 00:00:34.647
and then I started to realize

00:00:34.647 --> 00:00:37.293
that my hair looked like
it was starting to thin.

00:00:37.293 --> 00:00:39.554
- Track alopecia is when
people braid their hair.

00:00:39.554 --> 00:00:41.314
It breaks the follicles.

00:00:41.314 --> 00:00:42.946
- I feel like, at one point

00:00:42.946 --> 00:00:45.112
someone talked about a widow's peak

00:00:45.112 --> 00:00:46.135
and if you had that,

00:00:46.135 --> 00:00:47.746
then it meant that you
were gonna lose your hair.

00:00:47.746 --> 00:00:48.749
And that freaked me out for a minute.

00:00:48.749 --> 00:00:49.911
Which, I don't think is true.

00:00:49.911 --> 00:00:51.714
- When the guys see
their hairline go back,

00:00:51.714 --> 00:00:52.547
a little bit more.

00:00:52.547 --> 00:00:54.050
That's natural.

00:00:54.050 --> 00:00:57.175
To have your hairline
recede just a little bit.

00:00:57.175 --> 00:00:59.234
- My oldest has a little
bit of thinning here.

00:00:59.234 --> 00:01:01.751
Because of that, well
maybe I would thin out.

00:01:01.751 --> 00:01:04.866
And he started thinning at my age now.

00:01:04.866 --> 00:01:06.807
- The general age of someone losing hair,

00:01:06.807 --> 00:01:08.640
that I've experienced;

00:01:09.511 --> 00:01:12.511
is between the age of 20 to like 30,

00:01:13.837 --> 00:01:15.735
maybe even early 30's.

00:01:15.735 --> 00:01:18.018
(dramatic music)

00:01:18.018 --> 00:01:20.013
As far as I see here, it's perfect.

00:01:20.013 --> 00:01:21.837
And if I'm running my hands through it,

00:01:21.837 --> 00:01:22.957
it's perfect too.

00:01:22.957 --> 00:01:24.354
You have medium to coarse hair

00:01:24.354 --> 00:01:25.655
