00:01:31.533 --> 00:01:33.735
I really don't see any areas of concern.

00:01:33.735 --> 00:01:34.574
- Okay.

00:01:34.574 --> 00:01:35.407
- (laughs)

00:01:35.407 --> 00:01:36.908
- Alright, cool.

00:01:36.908 --> 00:01:37.741
