00:01:41.057 --> 00:01:42.996
Six months, get ready."

00:01:42.996 --> 00:01:44.587
- (David) Your hairline is healthy,

00:01:44.587 --> 00:01:45.916
which is great.

00:01:45.916 --> 00:01:47.836
Your natural dreads are awesome.

00:01:47.836 --> 00:01:50.065
I don't see a lot of concerns here.

00:01:50.065 --> 00:01:51.857
I do see slight concern in the back.

00:01:51.857 --> 00:01:52.690
Slight.

00:01:52.690 --> 00:01:53.523
