00:01:57.062 --> 00:02:00.500
And minoxidil, basically
is it helps to block

00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:04.667
any extra hormones which causes
the hair loss suffocation,

00:02:05.642 --> 00:02:07.309
in the derma layers.

00:02:09.066 --> 00:02:10.484
(laughs)

00:02:10.484 --> 00:02:13.817
I don't really see any areas of concern.

00:02:13.817 --> 00:02:15.340
- I'm gonna be thick for days!

00:02:15.340 --> 00:02:16.641
- Oh my God!

00:02:16.641 --> 00:02:19.063
I can see how you probably
would think in the hairline,

00:02:19.063 --> 00:02:20.396
because your hair is fine

00:02:20.396 --> 00:02:22.177
and it's lighter.

00:02:22.177 --> 00:02:24.161
So, you could see right
